    "Paste an OpenSSH/PEM private key (e.g. the contents of ~/.ssh/your_key). Passphrase-protected keys aren't supported yet — use an unencrypted key. This is how your shell already logs in.": "atelierHosting.privateKeyHelp",
    "Tap 👁 to reveal the password and check the on-screen keyboard didn't change it (a single wrong character reads to the server as a failed login).": "atelierHosting.passwordHelp",
    "Remote folder (web ROOT)": "atelierHosting.remoteFolder",
    "Remote folder and URL prefix must point at the SAME place — the web root. Don't add a subfolder: Atelier creates its own atelier/… path under both. e.g. /var/www/html/ ↔ https://eurobuddha.com/ . First connect asks you to confirm the server's fingerprint.": "atelierHosting.remoteHelp",
