    "\"Permanent storage via ArDrive Turbo — no account or signup; your wallet below IS the identity. Files under ~100 KiB upload free; larger files spend the prepaid balance attached to your wallet address (~$0.61 per 20 MiB — fund at https://turbo.ar.io). Uploads are PERMANENT and can never be deleted or overwritten. Fresh URLs take ~5–10 minutes to start serving.\"": "atelierHosting.arweaveHelp",
